  dialogue1:
  - Woahhhhhh... there's a really cool tapestry on this wall.
  - It's so detailed... whoever made this spent a lot of time and effort on it.
  - I'm so glad I can see this for myself...
  dialogue2:
  - I'm quite mesmerized by this tapestry. It's so awesome!
  - Everyone should be able to see this!
