--- !u!1001 &1207298436
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 763422771}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue1.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 3
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: 'A clothes drawer. I wonder what kind of clothes she wore when she was
        alive. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: Let's see... There's quite the variety of shirts, pants, skirts, and
        dresses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: A majority of the clothes are pink, but there are some blue and red
        items as well.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: With all of these clothes, I bet you could have enough unique outfits
        to last the year!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: 'A lot of the outfits would be overwhelmingly pink, but there''s still
        enough for some variety. '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: I bet she looked super cute in these clothes.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3597252035074719195, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Interactable Object
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6671789510596350034, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
