--- !u!1001 &1602455398
PrefabInstance:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  serializedVersion: 2
  m_Modification:
    serializedVersion: 3
    m_TransformParent: {fileID: 1013957836}
    m_Modifications:
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue1.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: dialogue2.Array.size
      value: 4
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: A TV that turns on by itself. How spooky.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: Maybe she watches this when she isn't busy forcing people to solve her
        death house.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[2]'
      value: 'That does make me wonder what kinds of channels a ghost would enjoy? '
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[3]'
      value: Would she enjoy those ghost hunting shows, or would those upset her?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: The TV being a flatscreen suggests that she died fairly recently.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: Usually, haunted houses are full of stuff that are decades old, but
        not this one.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: Of course, it's possible that she did die decades ago, and someone put
        this TV in here recently.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[3]'
      value: ............that's stupid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 3597252035074719195, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Name
      value: Interactable Object
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6671789510596350034, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_LocalScale.x
      value: 3.4006
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6671789510596350034, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
