    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[0]'
      value: This must be her bed. It looks comfortable.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue1.Array.data[1]'
      value: Hmm? That's strange... the bedsheets are missing.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[0]'
      value: The bed may be missing the bedsheets, but it still looks comfortable
        enough to sleep on.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[1]'
      value: Now that I think about it, it was evening when I got to the house.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2615303210128171141, guid: 0658a3366fc0ea044a1404403502f174, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue2.Array.data[2]'
      value: I wonder what time it is right now.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
